; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 25. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'gw82_trail_intro'
gw82_trail_intro.dialogstring_07B550! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Lance's tracks led me to[N]the Great Wall of China.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]The passageway continued[N]without end beyond the[N]horizon…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'gw82_necklace_stone'
gw82_necklace_stone.dialogstring_07B611! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]A pretty pebble has[N]fallen.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Aha! This is a part of the[N]necklace that Lance made[N]for Lilly…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2]You picked up the[N]necklace's stone for him.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'gw83_lily'
gw83_lily.dialogstring_07B6FF! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Wait![END]`
gw83_lily.dialogstring_07B709! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You're going to[N]search for Lance, right?[FIN]I'm going too…!![END]`
gw83_lily.dialogstring_07B731! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Eheheh. It's been[N]a long time since I've[N]borrowed your pocket like[N]this, huh?[FIN]Alright, let's go…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E428! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The Great Wall holds[N]slopes too steep to climb[N]normally. Thy Spin Dash[N]can carry thee upward.[FIN][RET]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08ECEA! `Spin Dash is a power that[N]only Will, the boy, can[N]use.[FIN]Thine own high-speed[N]rotation can send enemies[N]flying. Thou can run up[N]hills that use recoil.[FIN]Tap Block repeatedly[N]while holding Attack.`

?INCLUDE 'gw8A_sand_fanger'
gw8A_sand_fanger.dialogstring_0B80B5! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]After you defeated Sand[N]Fanger, you found a[N]Mystic Statue from its[N]corpse!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'gw8B_lance_lily'
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B824! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Lance, you idiot…[N]You had me worried…!![FIN]What would you do if the[N]demons killed you…!![FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: It's my bad fer[N]worryin' everyone.[FIN]But I obtained medicine ta[N]cure my old man's illness.[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BB89! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Geez…[N]He's selfish, after all…[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B8AD! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Ah, those stones[N]are…[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: We arrived here when[N]we followed these pebbles.[FIN]I'll return the stones to[N]you. Here you go…[WAI][CLD][PAU:3C][::][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][SFX:0][DLY:2]Lance whispered…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][SFX:0][DLY:2]Lance: Will…won't ya leave[N]me with Lilly fer just a[N]little bit?[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B960! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:2]Lance: I was saved with[N]tha help o' these stones…[FIN]Tha truth is,[N]I made this fer ya…[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B9B1! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: It's missin' a few[N]stones now, but[AD] will ya[N]take it anyway?[FIN][CLD][DEF][SFX:0]Lance gently fastens the[N]necklace around Lilly's[N]neck.[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BBB0! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Lance: Ah…[WAI][CLD][PAU:40][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:2]Lilly: I won't run away[N]this time…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:2]Last time, I wasn't[N]expecting what you did. I[N]was surprised and didn't[N]know what I should do…[FIN]But right now, I just[N]don't want you to be able[N]to see my face.[FIN]I'm so happy that my[N]tears are flooding out…[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BC42! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Lance[AD] From the[N]first time we met, there[N]was something about you I[N]couldn't explain.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Now I think I understand[N]what it was.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]And I know the answer I[N]wanted to give you before.[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BCAA! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly:[N][DLY:3]I care about you, too…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:3][DLY:2]It would be nice if we[N]could always be together,[N]wouldn't it…?[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BA2E! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Yahoo!![N]I've never felt like this![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I'm happier than the first[N]day of summer vacation![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: *sniffle*[N]Me too.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Come on. Everyone's[N]probably worried about us.[END]`
